@startuml kairos-admin-sends-announcements-sequence
title Admin Sends Announcement

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB
participant "Messaging" as Messaging

Admin -> WebAdmin: Open Announcements Page\nClick "New Announcement"
Admin -> WebAdmin: Compose title/body\nSelect target (branch/departments)\nClick "Publish"
WebAdmin -> API: POST /announcements {title, body, targets}
API -> DB: INSERT Announcement
DB --> API: announcementId

API -> DB: SELECT affected users
DB --> API: user list
API -> DB: INSERT Notifications for each user
DB --> API: OK

API -> Messaging: Send emails/push where applicable
Messaging --> API: Accepted
API --> WebAdmin: 201 Created

WebAdmin --> Admin: Show "Announcement sent"

@enduml
